        "content": "look at these traits. which 5 of them do you think could be the best/universal combination for any kind of ruler?\n\nenvious = {\n\tintrigue = 2\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n\tliege_opinion = -15\n}\n\ngreedy = {\n\tglobal_tax_modifier = 0.1\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n}\n\nlustful = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = -0.25\n\tintrigue = 1\n\tfertility = 0.2\n}\n\nproud = {\n\tmonthly_character_prestige = 0.5\n}\n\nwroth = {\n\tmartial = 3\n\tintrigue = -1\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n}\n\ncharitable = {\n\tdiplomacy = 3\n\tcombat_rating = -3\n}\n\nchaste = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = 0.5\n\tlearning = 1\n\tfertility = -0.15\n}\n\ndiligent = {\n\tmartial = 1\n\tintrigue = 1\n\tdiplomacy = 1\n\tstewardship = 1\n\tlearning = 1\n\tvassal_opinion = 5\n}\n\nhumble = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = 1.0\n}\n\nkind = {\n\tintrigue = -2\n\tdiplomacy = 2\n\tcombat_rating = -5\n}\n\npatient = {\n\tintrigue = 1\n\tdiplomacy = 1\n\tstewardship = 1\n\tlearning = 1\n\tcombat_rating = 5\n}\n\ntemperate = {\n\tstewardship = 2\n}\n\nambitious = {\n\tmartial = 2\n\tintrigue = 2\n\tdiplomacy = 2\n\tstewardship = 2\n\tlearning = 2\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n}\n\narbitrary = {\n\tintrigue = 1\n\tstewardship = -2\n\tlearning = -1\n}\n\nbrave = {\n\tmartial = 2\n\tcombat_rating = 10\n}\n\ncontent = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = 0.5\n\tintrigue = -1\n\tliege_opinion = 25\n}\n\ncruel = {\n\tintrigue = 1\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n}\n\ncynical = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = -0.2\n\tintrigue = 2\n}\n\ndeceitful = {\n\tintrigue = 3\n\tdiplomacy = -2\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n}\n\nerudite = {\n\tlearning = 2\n\tcombat_rating = -2\n}\n\ngregarious = {\n\tdiplomacy = 2\n\tsex_appeal_opinion = 5\n}\n\nhonest = {\n\tintrigue = -2\n\tdiplomacy = 3\n\tcombat_rating = -2\n}\n\njust = {\n\tstewardship = 2\n\tlearning = 1\n}\n\nparanoid = {\n\tintrigue = 2\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n}\n\nstubborn = {\n\tdiplomacy = -1\n\tstewardship = 1\n\tcombat_rating = 3\n}\n\nzealous = {\n\tmonthly_character_piety = 1\n\tmartial = 2\n\topinion_against_infidels = -25\n}",
